     "<div dir=\"ltr\">各位高手好<div><br></div><div>想請教應該如何解決使用 rstudio 讀取 .rdata 檔案後的亂碼問題，截圖如下，</div><div>感恩</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-N_OqWo-w8jg/Wk72AhOsG8I/AAAAAAAAAyg/htkERrIeeEYgmhfsPx85YkObCLJOgS9QwCLcBGAs/s1600/%25E8%259E%25A2%25E5%25B9%2595%25E5%25BF%25AB%25E7%2585%25A7%2B2018-01-05%2B%25E4%25B8%258A%25E5%258D%258811.44.16.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-N_OqWo-w8jg/Wk72AhOsG8I/AAAAAAAAAyg/htkERrIeeEYgmhfsPx85YkObCLJOgS9QwCLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E8%25259E%2525A2%2525E5%2525B9%252595%2525E5%2525BF%2525AB%2525E7%252585%2525A7%252B2018-01-05%252B%2525E4%2525B8%25258A%2525E5%25258D%25258811.44.16.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237415247000&amp;usg=AOvVaw32cMgwfctk_16oM92N07tY\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-N_OqWo-w8jg/Wk72AhOsG8I/AAAAAAAAAyg/htkERrIeeEYgmhfsPx85YkObCLJOgS9QwCLcBGAs/s320/%25E8%259E%25A2%25E5%25B9%2595%25E5%25BF%25AB%25E7%2585%25A7%2B2018-01-05%2B%25E4%25B8%258A%25E5%258D%258811.44.16.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"268\"></a></p><div><br></div></div>"
