  {
   "id": "2GKkoqGoAgAJ",
   "from": "WEPA ^_^",
   "author": "d42e88b7645d03c8",
   "date": "2018-01-06T02:31:29Z",
   "subject": "Re: 想請教有關 mac 讀取 .RData 卻得到亂碼的解決方法",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi 志豪,<div><br></div><div>1. 讀取會有亂碼問題, 可能原因是 RData 是在 Windows 環境使用 save 匯出, Windows 與 Mac 二者編碼不同.</div><div><br></div><div>2. 以下範例資料在 Windows 系統儲存成 RData, 使用 Mac 載入會有亂碼, 配合 iconv函數可進行編碼轉換(?iconv), 欄位名稱應該亦可轉換:</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-W2R1PG2M_D8/WlAzmvY9n_I/AAAAAAAAP_k/Hxwg7Ptk930WH2aTThceBuKisL-M95UkACLcBGAs/s1600/mac_iconv.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-W2R1PG2M_D8/WlAzmvY9n_I/AAAAAAAAP_k/Hxwg7Ptk930WH2aTThceBuKisL-M95UkACLcBGAs/s1600/mac_iconv.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237415248000&amp;usg=AOvVaw00YYafotTGXgQD29-5oC2t\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-W2R1PG2M_D8/WlAzmvY9n_I/AAAAAAAAP_k/Hxwg7Ptk930WH2aTThceBuKisL-M95UkACLcBGAs/s400/mac_iconv.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"241\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">mydata$supplier </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> iconv</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mydata$supplier</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;BIG-5&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;UTF-8&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div># end<br><br>蕭志豪於 2018年1月5日星期五 UTC+8上午11時50分48秒寫道：</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">各位高手好<div><br></div><div>想請教應該如何解決使用 rstudio 讀取 .rdata 檔案後的亂碼問題，截圖如下，</div><div>感恩</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-N_OqWo-w8jg/Wk72AhOsG8I/AAAAAAAAAyg/htkERrIeeEYgmhfsPx85YkObCLJOgS9QwCLcBGAs/s1600/%25E8%259E%25A2%25E5%25B9%2595%25E5%25BF%25AB%25E7%2585%25A7%2B2018-01-05%2B%25E4%25B8%258A%25E5%258D%258811.44.16.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-N_OqWo-w8jg/Wk72AhOsG8I/AAAAAAAAAyg/htkERrIeeEYgmhfsPx85YkObCLJOgS9QwCLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E8%25259E%2525A2%2525E5%2525B9%252595%2525E5%2525BF%2525AB%2525E7%252585%2525A7%252B2018-01-05%252B%2525E4%2525B8%25258A%2525E5%25258D%25258811.44.16.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237415248000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2LZGtYkWnticShGavD4IZe\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-N_OqWo-w8jg/Wk72AhOsG8I/AAAAAAAAAyg/htkERrIeeEYgmhfsPx85YkObCLJOgS9QwCLcBGAs/s320/%25E8%259E%25A2%25E5%25B9%2595%25E5%25BF%25AB%25E7%2585%25A7%2B2018-01-05%2B%25E4%25B8%258A%25E5%258D%258811.44.16.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"268\"></a></p><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
